{
  "name": "SaaS Vendor SOC 2 & AI Subprocessor Change Alerts to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SaaS Trust Center, SOC 2 & AI Subprocessor Monitor (TPRM)\n\nMonitors your SaaS vendors' Trust Centers (**Vanta, Drata, SafeBase, Conveyor, Whistic, Secureframe, OneTrust**) daily for compliance regressions or newly added **AI subprocessors** (OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS Bedrock, Google Vertex AI, etc.).\n\n### Setup Steps\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential in n8n (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>` from https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations) and attach it to **Run Trust Center Monitor**.\n2. Edit `domains` in the JSON body to match your actual SaaS vendors.\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential to **Send Security Alert to Slack** and choose your `#security-alerts` channel.\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/saas-trust-center-soc2-monitor\n**Cost:** $5.00 / 1,000 compliance changes · **$0 on baseline or unchanged vendors** · 128 MB RAM · pure HTTP.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Daily at 9 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/maitreya_buddha~saas-trust-center-soc2-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "memory",
              "value": "256"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"domains\": [\n    \"apify.com\",\n    \"linear.app\",\n    \"canva.com\"\n  ],\n  \"mode\": \"monitor\",\n  \"stateStoreName\": \"saas-trust-monitor-state\",\n  \"checkSubprocessors\": true,\n  \"checkDnsIam\": true,\n  \"concurrency\": 5,\n  \"emitBaselineSummary\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Run Trust Center Monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recordType }}",
              "rightValue": "baseline_initialized",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Only Compliance & AI Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "security-alerts",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:shield: *Vendor TPRM Alert* (`{{ $json.eventType }}`)\n*Vendor Domain:* {{ $json.domain }}\n*Trust Center:* {{ $json.trustCenterUrl || 'N/A' }} ({{ $json.trustCenterPlatform || 'Unknown' }})\n*Previous -> New:* {{ $json.previousValue || 'None' }} -> *{{ $json.newValue || 'N/A' }}*\n*AI Subprocessors:* {{ ($json.aiSubprocessors && $json.aiSubprocessors.length) ? $json.aiSubprocessors.join(', ') : 'None' }}\n*Detected At:* {{ $json.detectedAt }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Send Security Alert to Slack",
